  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="48">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 48</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="48" corresp="#wit-d-incomplete">And þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> hi ælþeodige men ⁊ feorran cumene ne tyrian ne tynan.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="48" corresp="#wit-k">And þæt hi ælþeodige men ⁊ feorran cumene ne tyrian ne tynan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">And that they should not vex or oppress strangers and men come from afar.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und dass sie fremde und fernher gekommene Menschen nicht plagen noch quälen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And that they do not vex or harass foreigners and people come from afar.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares Af El. 33.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
